    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>残酷的现实是这几天下过雨。天空也一直是多云的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>缺少了阳光，连海水都变得阴沉下来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是就莫名其妙的省下了原本去潜水和迎着日落跳滑伞伞的迎着日落跳滑伞伞的费用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>省到就是赚到啊！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>学会与天气共处</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>跑题回忆摆摊卖团扇的炎热</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>格局打开搞物价</span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>逛了一圈坐了半天 分界书屋</span></strong></p>]]></description>
