  <item>
    <title>Day2 最开始的50km，停车没停人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666125ce94977a26ef8ad369</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666125ce94977a26ef8ad369</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Jun 2024 02:58:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>从海口坐高铁到琼海，海口高铁站是在地下的，虽然我也知道我们国家基建实力强大，但是呢，第一次在地底坐高铁，也是有点小兴奋呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>被迫自助租车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>吃点东北菜补充体力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>万万没想到，停车会比开车难。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>终于，在上一个不知名的长坡时，我想要停下来喝点水，结果由于车速相对较快，连人带车一起摔得过分愉快</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>这天日落的时候，我记得非常清楚，我一打开窗户，就看到一道好肥大的彩虹横挂在天空中。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>当时我也不知道啊，当时这彩虹对我意味着什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmUI-bn3749JYWDnOM3ZPWVgYTNa.m4a" length="8360895" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:08:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0W3s6DbOIUdAo7c1PGbzidRz63.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Day1 一人两轮 流浪海南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66601baa63c334a2fb869a74</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66601baa63c334a2fb869a74</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Jun 2024 08:02:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你很想出逃，但又觉得无处可逃，不知道逃往何方，欢迎你来到我的频道，在这我想和你分享一个人骑行背包徒步的流浪故事，不完全靠谱，但现在还活着，哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>总要来一次一个人的流浪骑行吧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>很久以前看完梁永安老师《阅读、游历和爱情》这本书以后，用生命投入感的进入到一件事情中，就成了我要做一件事情的一个标准。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>骑行前的准备有哪些呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么选择海南？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么从0~1计划出适合自己舒适度的骑行计划呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来跟大家讲一下装备方面要带什么上路，为什么要带？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>问清自己，得到答案，收拾好装备，一起出发吧。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llXNmcVwN2bYYF_PNuV4Zk-MZio0.m4a" length="8489317" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:08:39</itunes:duration>
